# tutor: the whole of `merl --tutor`, each lesson's answer as the tutor's tests press it, to the
# three review lessons at its end (#158): the sample project becomes an agent's uncommitted work
# over one commit, the review panel takes the left, `c` walks cli.py on into models.py, `C` walks
# back, and `m` ticks store.py
merl --tutor
wait Tutor 1/
key o
type store
key Enter
wait Tutor 2/
key /
type load_config
key Enter n d [ ] u
wait Usages
key Down Enter s
type TODO
wait reject a note
key Enter
wait Tutor 9/
key D
type NoteStore
wait store.py:9
key Enter
wait Tutor 10/
key :
type 42
key Enter } { v v v t Tab Enter Enter
type #hi
key Escape C-z w p f Escape
wait Tutor 23/
key Escape
wait Tutor 24/
key c*6
wait Tutor 25/
key C
wait Tutor 26/
key m
wait That is all of merl
